{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>A Sabbath to HaShem.</b> He who forms light and creates darkness fixes it in all your settlements. Even though the onset of day and night changes according to the variation of latitude across regions, and the first Sabbath was necessarily reckoned according to some particular latitude — nevertheless, the beginning and end of the Sabbath in each region will be for its inhabitants according to the onset of day and night in that region."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:23.598525440Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}